# steam-frozen: the full 64-bit Steam client (SteamRT3, steamrt64), versioned
# and owned by pacman in /opt/steam. Steam's self-updater is off; bump
# with ./update.sh (Valve's client manifest -> pkgver + sources).
#
# No 32-bit files: Valve's 32-bit reaper is replaced by a 64-bit build, every
# other 32-bit ELF (steamrt32, linux32, ubuntu12_32) and the scout runtime are
# dropped. The client's own runtime (steamrt3c) isn't packaged either: sruman
# links it into the user's Steam folder.
#
# Built from Valve's CDN at build time; don't redistribute built packages.

pkgbase=steam-frozen
pkgname=(steam-frozen steam-devices)
# BEGIN client (generated by update.sh, do not edit)
pkgver=1794536281
